{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o099b","title":"会稽报嘉禾大赦改明年元","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o099b-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"会稽报嘉禾大赦改明年元","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o099b-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":231,"label":"冬十月至十二月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y231","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o097","basis":"冬十月至十二月"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o099b-q","wuzhu-q-o097","zhuge-q-o038","zhuge-q-b-d3a3709d8bfa728137f8"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o099b-q","source_order":[47,507,"O099b"],"order":8301}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o099b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-ffa2d01954ad1c4004b1","layer":"original","quote":"会稽南始平言嘉禾生〖13〗。十二月丁卯，大赦，改明年元也。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":506,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":22,"end":51},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o097","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-933251543c833a99d654","layer":"original","quote":"三年春二月〖9〗，遣太常潘濬率众五万讨武陵蛮夷〖10〗。卫温、诸葛直，皆以违诏无功，下狱诛。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":504,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":46},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-d3a3709d8bfa728137f8","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-d3a3709d8bfa728137f8","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗九年：建兴九年（公元 231）。张郃中箭身亡之处名叫木门，在今天水西南约 60 余公里的牡丹乡木门村，位于祁山以东不远。木门道所经过的峡谷，深邃陡峭，最窄处宽度仅 50 米左右。附近曾有当时的箭镞、刀、矛、弓等文物出土。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":268,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-7893325ea43d52084752","start":0,"end":113},{"id":"zhuge-q-o038","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-975c90b64c3e4282352a","layer":"original","quote":"九年〖1〗，亮复出祁山，以木牛运，﹝一﹞粮尽退军；与魏将张郃交战，射杀郃。﹝二﹞","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":257,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
